'''Wondermaria''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wondermaria
|image = E 454.png
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Wondermaria has the skills of an equipped pusher: high speed, high damage, relatively high range, and a guaranteed chance to knockback your cats. However, this enemy has a large delay between attacks leaving Wondermaria open for attacks. Treat her like a much stronger, floating [[H. Nah]].

==Strategy==
Wondermaria has amazing pushing power, and attacks fast enough to where most units that don't outrange her can't get good hits in. Nonetheless, she herself can be outranged by backliners like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. Additionally, rushers like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can sneak in hits on Wondermaria realtively easily, and can gradually wear down her 1 million HP. It's only really her support that tends to pose a problem, so bring a tank like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], as well as many small meatshields to counter them.

